  "details": "I've thought of this idea of a shared homeworld last night with my friends. This could work with the upcoming Group feature that was in the Developer Stream where there would be a shared homeworld with your friends. Basically if you all log on on different times you'll all be in the same homeworld. For example, Persona A logs on at 6pm and is just looking for worlds. Person B joins at around 6:10 PM and they would join the same world Person A would be in. I'm very bad at explaining things so sorry about that but I was just thinking this was a cool idea. Thank you for reading and I hope you have a good day 😊👐",
